<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net">
  <diagram name="Page-1" id="sonp0LXXturf5sv1Ke2g">
    <mxGraphModel grid="1" page="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\nallowmixing\nhide empty description\n\nskinparam backgroundColor transparent\nskinparam DefaultFontColor white\nskinparam ArrowColor white\nskinparam ArrowFontColor white\nskinparam shadowing false\n\nskinparam object {\n    BackgroundColor transparent\n    BorderColor white\n    FontColor white\n    AttributeFontColor white\n}\n\nskinparam actor {\n    BackgroundColor transparent\n    BorderColor white\n    FontColor white\n}\n\nskinparam note {\n    BackgroundColor transparent\n    BorderColor white\n    FontColor white\n}\n\ntitle interaction : AI Smart Study Bot\n\n&#39; ═══════════════════════\n&#39; LIFELINES\n&#39; ═══════════════════════\n\nactor  \&quot;student : User\&quot;                      as user\nobject \&quot;bc : BotController\&quot;                  as ctrl\nobject \&quot;sc[schedule.json] : ScheduleConfig\&quot;  as json\nobject \&quot;:Scheduler\&quot;                          as sched\nobject \&quot;ba : BrowserAutomation\&quot;              as browser\nobject \&quot;wb : WhisperAI\&quot;                      as whisper\nobject \&quot;vl : VoiceListener\&quot;                  as voice\nobject \&quot;ca : ChatAnalyzer\&quot;                   as chat\nobject \&quot;am : AttendanceManager\&quot;              as att\nobject \&quot;ar : AIResponder\&quot;                    as responder\nobject \&quot;api[gemini] : GeminiAPI\&quot;             as gem\nobject \&quot;api[groq] : GroqAPI\&quot;                 as groq\nobject \&quot;nm : NotificationManager\&quot;            as notif\nobject \&quot;tg : TelegramBotAPI\&quot;                 as telegram\nobject \&quot;ex : ExceptionHandler\&quot;               as ex\n\n&#39; ═══════════════════════\n&#39; LINKS &amp; MESSAGES\n&#39; ═══════════════════════\n\n&#39; 1. USER BOOTS THE BOT\nuser -- ctrl\nnote on link\n  &gt; 1: run(RUN.BAT)\n  &gt; 1.1: SMART_SETUP()\n  &gt; 1.2: VERIFY_INSTALL()\n  &lt; 1.3 [failed]: retrySetup()\nend note\n\n&#39; 2. CONFIGURATION\nuser -- json\nnote on link\n  &gt; 2.1: googleLogin()\n  &gt; 2.2: configureSchedule()\nend note\n\njson -- ctrl\nnote on link\n  &gt; 2.3: configLoaded()\nend note\n\n&#39; 3. SCHEDULER START\nctrl -- sched\nnote on link\n  &gt; 3: startScheduler()\n  &gt; 12.7 [next class]: resumeScheduler()\nend note\n\nsched -- json\nnote on link\n  &gt; 3.1: readSchedule()\n  &lt; 3.2: return(class_time, link)\nend note\n\n&#39; 4. POLLING LOOP\nsched -- sched\nnote on link\n  4 *[time != class_time]: pollTime()\n  4.1 [elapsed &gt; 20min]: markClassMissed()\nend note\n\nsched -- notif\nnote on link\n  &gt; 4.2 [missed]: sendNotification(\&quot;Class Missed\&quot;)\nend note\n\nsched -- browser\nnote on link\n  &gt; 4.3 [on time]: triggerJoin(link)\n  &gt; 4.4 [within 20min late]: triggerJoin(link)\nend note\n\n&#39; 5. CLASS JOINING\nbrowser -- browser\nnote on link\n  5: launchChromium()\n  5.1: openMeetingURL()\n  5.2: disableMicrophone()\n  5.3: disableCamera()\n  5.4: openChatbox()\n  5.5: enableCaptions()\n  5.6: setCaptionLanguage(Urdu)\nend note\n\nbrowser -- notif\nnote on link\n  &gt; 5.7 [joined]: notifyJoined()\n  &gt; 12.4: sendSummary(duration)\nend note\n\n&#39; 6. VOICE MONITORING\nbrowser -- voice\nnote on link\n  &gt; 6: startVoiceMonitor()\nend note\n\nvoice -- whisper\nnote on link\n  &gt; 6.1 *[stream active]: transcribeAudio()\n  &lt; 6.2: return(transcript)\nend note\n\nvoice -- att\nnote on link\n  &gt; 6.3 [keyword detected]: triggerAttendance(\&quot;voice\&quot;)\n  &gt; 6.4 [name detected]: triggerAttendance(\&quot;name\&quot;)\nend note\n\nvoice -- responder\nnote on link\n  &gt; 6.5 [question detected]: forwardQuestion()\nend note\n\n&#39; 7. CHAT SCANNING\nbrowser -- chat\nnote on link\n  &gt; 7: startChatMonitor()\nend note\n\nchat -- chat\nnote on link\n  7.1 *[message received]: scanMessage()\n  7.2 [Present pattern]: incrementBurst()\nend note\n\nchat -- att\nnote on link\n  &gt; 7.3 [burst &gt;= 4]: triggerAttendance(\&quot;chat\&quot;)\nend note\n\n&#39; 8. ATTENDANCE MANAGER\natt -- att\nnote on link\n  8: evaluateTrigger() [90-95% accuracy]\n  8.1 [invalid]: startResetTimer(5min)\n  8.2 [elapsed]: clearTrigger()\nend note\n\natt -- browser\nnote on link\n  &gt; 8.3 [valid]: typeInChat(\&quot;Present\&quot;)\n  &lt; 8.4 [OK]: confirmAttendance()\n  &lt; 8.5 [error]: reportFailure()\nend note\n\natt -- notif\nnote on link\n  &gt; 8.6 [marked]: sendNotification(\&quot;Attendance Marked\&quot;)\n  &gt; 8.7 [failed]: sendNotification(\&quot;Attendance Missed\&quot;)\nend note\n\n&#39; 9. AI QUESTION ANSWERING\nresponder -- gem\nnote on link\n  &gt; 9: sendQuestion(text)\n  &lt; 9.1 [OK]: return(answer)\n  &lt; 9.2 [error]: return(api_error)\nend note\n\nresponder -- groq\nnote on link\n  &gt; 9.3 [Gemini failed]: sendQuestion(text)\n  &lt; 9.4 [OK]: return(answer)\n  &lt; 9.5 [failed]: return(api_error)\nend note\n\nresponder -- browser\nnote on link\n  &gt; 9.6 [answer ready]: typeInChat(answer)\nend note\n\nresponder -- ex\nnote on link\n  &gt; 9.7 [both APIs failed]: logAPIFailure()\nend note\n\n&#39; 10. TELEGRAM NOTIFICATIONS\nnotif -- telegram\nnote on link\n  &gt; 10 *[event fires]: telegramAlert(message)\n  — Class Joined / Left\n  — Attendance Marked / Missed\n  — Class Missed / Join Failed\nend note\n\n&#39; 11. EXCEPTION HANDLING\nctrl -- ex\nnote on link\n  &gt; 11 [exception]: handleException()\n  &lt; 11.4 [login timeout]: triggerReLogin()\nend note\n\nex -- ex\nnote on link\n  11.1: logToFile(error, timestamp)\nend note\n\nex -- sched\nnote on link\n  &gt; 11.2 [network failure]: resumeAfterReconnect()\nend note\n\nex -- notif\nnote on link\n  &gt; 11.3 [invalid link]: sendNotification(\&quot;Class Missed\&quot;)\nend note\n\n&#39; 12. CLASS EXIT\nctrl -- ctrl\nnote on link\n  12 *[class active]: checkExitConditions()\n  12.8 [no more classes]: shutdownBot()\nend note\n\nctrl -- browser\nnote on link\n  &gt; 12.1 [participants&lt;5 OR +5min]: leaveClass()\n  &lt; 12.2 [left]: confirmLeft(duration)\nend note\n\nctrl -- json\nnote on link\n  &gt; 12.5: checkNextClass()\n  &lt; 12.6 [found]: return(next_class_data)\nend note\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;format&quot;: &quot;svg&quot;&#xa;}" id="cpjr4K4gEmt9eXvo5rLB-3">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="shape=image;noLabel=1;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/svg+xml,;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="1484" width="3591" x="1270" y="1520" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
